<title>SINGAPORE: Kian Ann hits high of S$0.97 at debut.</title>
<headline>Kian Ann hits high of S$0.97 at debut.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kian Ann Engineering Ltd's shares hit a high of Singapore $0.97 at its debut in early trading on Tuesday against its initial public offer price of S$0.60  </p>
<p>At 0107 GMT, the shares were hovering around S$0.965 after touching a high of S$0.99 cents.  Volume was brisk with over 4.1 million units traded.</p>
<p>Kian Ann's IPO was 30.4 times subscribed when its offer closed last week. The subscription rate was one of the best in 1996 for new share offers in Singapore.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
</text>
